## Approval Workflow

```mermaid
graph LR
  A[Code Change] --> B{File?}
  B -->|InputFormMobile| C[Check constraints]
  B -->|InputForm| D[Block if layout change]
  B -->|Wrapper| E[Check props passing]
  C --> F{Pass?}
  D --> F
  E --> F
  F -->|Yes| G[Allow commit]
  F -->|No| H[Block + show violations]
```

